ucrtmath contains modified portions of AMD AOCL-LibM, BSD-3-Clause:
https://github.com/amd/aocl-libm-ose
Commit: 29fd054f383e6c5e2dec2fce781d5220059f1836

Original copyright notices, redistribution conditions, and disclaimers are
retained in each derived source file. upstream.json records original file hashes.

Sources: src/optimized/expf.c, src/optimized/powf.c, src/ref/atan2f.c,
src/optimized/expf_data.h, and only the referenced arrays from
src/optimized/data/_exp_j_by_64.c and src/optimized/log_tables.c.

Local modifications (F28, 2026-10-23): standalone scalar portability helpers,
explicit mode/API names and fused operations, bit-preserving table access,
expf signaling-NaN quieting, powf rounded log index/underflow threshold/NaN sign
handling (including identity paths and operand priority), and atan2f NaN
priority, exponent classification after widening and unsigned-index conversion.
No Microsoft implementation or binary is included. Compatibility observations
are recorded separately from the AMD-derived implementation.

Validation scope and remaining import work are described in README.md and the
F28 report.
